<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="519367019"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1363164654"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Stay (feat. Betsy Blue)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Yves V / Matthew Hill / Betsy Blue"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Stay (feat. Betsy Blue)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:08.205"><div begin="00:07.381" end="03:05.175"><p begin="00:07.381" end="00:09.564" itunes:key="L1">Please hold me close<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请将我抱紧</span></p><p begin="00:09.564" end="00:12.849" itunes:key="L2">And let me stay until the sunrise<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">允许我停留至日出之时</span></p><p begin="00:15.009" end="00:18.283" itunes:key="L3">Just say you'll hold me forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">说你会永远将我抱紧</span></p><p begin="00:18.283" end="00:21.476" itunes:key="L4">At least for tonight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">至少今晚如此</span></p><p begin="00:22.567" end="00:22.567" itunes:key="L5">It's been so long<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">许久没有如此靠近一个人</span></p><p begin="00:23.658" end="00:24.750" itunes:key="L6">Since I got so close to someone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道这并非爱 但允许我停留片刻</span></p><p begin="00:24.750" end="00:25.852" itunes:key="L7">I know this ain't love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道这并非爱情</span></p><p begin="00:25.852" end="00:29.103" itunes:key="L8">But let me stay a while<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但请允许我作片刻停留</span></p><p begin="00:30.195" end="00:31.286" itunes:key="L9">And pull me closer tonight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今晚靠近我吧 紧紧握着我的手</span></p><p begin="00:31.286" end="00:32.389" itunes:key="L10">Keep holding my hand<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道这并非爱 但允许我今晚留下</span></p><p begin="00:32.389" end="00:33.480" itunes:key="L11">I know this ain't love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道这并非爱情</span></p><p begin="00:33.480" end="00:36.661" itunes:key="L12">But let me stay the night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但请允许我今晚留在你的身边</span></p><p begin="00:36.661" end="00:38.844" itunes:key="L13">I said let me stay a while<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就让我稍作停驻</span></p><p begin="00:41.027" end="00:42.118" itunes:key="L14">I said let me stay a while<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就让我稍作停驻</span></p><p begin="00:44.301" end="00:46.472" itunes:key="L15">I said let me stay a while<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就让我稍作停驻</span></p><p begin="00:46.472" end="00:48.666" itunes:key="L16">(Ah-ah, ah, ah)</p><p begin="00:48.666" end="00:49.746" itunes:key="L17">I said let me stay a while<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就让我稍作停驻</span></p><p begin="00:49.746" end="00:51.929" itunes:key="L18">(Ah-ah, ah, ah)</p><p begin="00:51.929" end="00:54.111" itunes:key="L19">I said let me stay a while<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就让我稍作停驻</span></p><p begin="00:54.111" end="00:58.453" itunes:key="L20">(Ah-ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah-ah)</p><p begin="00:58.453" end="01:01.727" itunes:key="L21">I said let me stay a while</p><p begin="01:01.727" end="01:06.093" itunes:key="L22">(Ah-ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah-ah)</p><p begin="01:06.093" end="01:09.378" itunes:key="L23">I said let me stay a while</p><p begin="01:09.378" end="01:13.697" itunes:key="L24">(Ah-ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah-ah)</p><p begin="01:14.789" end="01:16.971" itunes:key="L25">I said let me stay a while<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就让我稍作停驻</span></p><p begin="01:16.971" end="01:21.337" itunes:key="L26">(Ah-ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah-ah)</p><p begin="01:21.337" end="01:24.611" itunes:key="L27">I said let me stay a while</p><p begin="01:28.215" end="01:29.215" itunes:key="L28">Girl</p><p begin="01:32.215" end="01:34.698" itunes:key="L29">No, no, I don't need a degree<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不</span></p><p begin="01:34.698" end="01:37.972" itunes:key="L30">To know this ain't love at first sight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不需要猜 我都明白 这并非一见钟情</span></p><p begin="01:37.972" end="01:42.338" itunes:key="L31">'Cause I know this how works</p><p begin="01:42.338" end="01:44.532" itunes:key="L32">I got my A-B-C's right<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的开局十分美好</span></p><p begin="01:45.623" end="01:48.166" itunes:key="L33">Oh, so let's play pretend</p><p begin="01:48.166" end="01:51.765" itunes:key="L34">And say you'll be the one for me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那就让我们假装爱情还在</span></p><p begin="01:51.765" end="01:53.948" itunes:key="L35">Say you'll be the one for me forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你会永远陪伴我</span></p><p begin="01:53.948" end="01:57.222" itunes:key="L36">I know this will end tonight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道一切就会在今晚结束</span></p><p begin="01:57.222" end="01:59.404" itunes:key="L37">But you'll be the one for me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但你就是我的唯一</span></p><p begin="01:59.404" end="02:01.587" itunes:key="L38">Say you'll be the one for me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你就是我的唯一</span></p><p begin="02:02.678" end="02:02.678" itunes:key="L39">It's been so long<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">许久没有如此靠近一个人</span></p><p begin="02:02.678" end="02:03.770" itunes:key="L40">Since I got so close to someone</p><p begin="02:04.861" end="02:05.302" itunes:key="L41">I know this ain't love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道这并非爱情</span></p><p begin="02:05.302" end="02:08.576" itunes:key="L42">But let me stay a while<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但请允许我作片刻停留</span></p><p begin="02:09.679" end="02:10.770" itunes:key="L43">And pull me closer tonight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今晚靠近我吧 紧紧握着我的手</span></p><p begin="02:10.770" end="02:11.862" itunes:key="L44">Keep holding my hand</p><p begin="02:11.862" end="02:12.965" itunes:key="L45">I know this ain't love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道这并非爱情</span></p><p begin="02:12.965" end="02:16.157" itunes:key="L46">But let me stay the night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但请允许我今晚留在你的身边</span></p><p begin="02:17.249" end="02:18.352" itunes:key="L47">I said let me stay a while<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就让我稍作停驻</span></p><p begin="02:20.534" end="02:22.729" itunes:key="L48">I said let me stay a while<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就让我稍作停驻</span></p><p begin="02:24.911" end="02:26.003" itunes:key="L49">I said let me stay a while<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就让我稍作停驻</span></p><p begin="02:26.003" end="02:28.174" itunes:key="L50">(Ah-ah, ah, ah)</p><p begin="02:28.174" end="02:30.368" itunes:key="L51">I said let me stay a while<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就让我稍作停驻</span></p><p begin="02:30.368" end="02:31.448" itunes:key="L52">(Ah-ah, ah, ah)</p><p begin="02:32.504" end="02:33.607" itunes:key="L53">I said let me stay a while<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就让我稍作停驻</span></p><p begin="02:33.607" end="02:39.064" itunes:key="L54">(Ah-ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah-ah)</p><p begin="02:39.064" end="02:41.235" itunes:key="L55">I said let me stay a while<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就让我稍作停驻</span></p><p begin="02:41.235" end="02:46.587" itunes:key="L56">(Ah-ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah-ah)</p><p begin="02:46.587" end="02:48.770" itunes:key="L57">I said let me stay a while<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就让我停留片刻</span></p><p begin="02:48.770" end="02:54.238" itunes:key="L58">(Ah-ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah-ah)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就让我稍作停驻</span></p><p begin="02:54.238" end="02:56.421" itunes:key="L59">I said let me stay a while<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就让我稍作停驻</span></p><p begin="02:56.421" end="03:01.878" itunes:key="L60">(Ah-ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah-ah)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就让我稍作停驻</span></p><p begin="03:01.878" end="03:05.175" itunes:key="L61">I said let me stay a while<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就让我停留片刻</span></p></div></body></tt>